    description: "deep-20260406-182616 reflect: slice.tier1.json and slice.tier2.json are byte-identical (465 nodes, 648 edges) for alertmanager, despite 801 internal_dep nodes existing in supply_chain. Tier-2 should add internal_dep nodes; the tier filter does not actually broaden the slice. Investigate slice.py tier handling. Also confirm whether this affects other repos in the bakeoff or is alertmanager-specific. Source: alertmanager.assessment.yaml dimension_scores.tier_classification=2 (lowest)."  # 9e88
