  message: "Yes — WI-puvab tracks the bakeoff diagnostic fix (created in the same investigation, P3 todo_soft, tagged bakeoff_infrastructure). It enumerates three fix options (exclude_tests=False, report tier-2 minus tier-1 as a direct metric, or skip the tier diff on test-dominated repos) and notes the deeper question of whether supply_chain should split tests into a distinct tier-4 instead of conflating with internal_dep. Awaiting prioritization."  # 223b
